Source: beanjar-qemu
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Mariotaku <git@mariotaku.me>
Homepage: https://github.com/mariotaku/beanjar-vendor

Package: beanjar-qemu
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, libegl1, libopengl0
Description: Beanjar patched QEMU
 qemu-system-aarch64 and its vhost-user-gpu backend, built from upstream
 QEMU with Beanjar's patches: a surfaceless EGL display for hosts without
 a DRM render node, D-Bus read-back of GL scanouts, and dropping a D-Bus
 listener whose connection closed. Beanjar's launcher runs it instead of
 Debian's qemu-system-arm whenever it is installed. It is installed under
 /usr/libexec/beanjar and /usr/share/beanjar/qemu, out of the way of
 Debian's QEMU.
